@startuml
title LoRa transport (T5.1/T5.1b) — node = opaque byte pipe (BLE NUS or USB serial)
autonumber
participant "SessionManager" as SM
participant "LoraTransport" as L
participant "LoraNodeLink\n(BleNodeLink | UsbSerialLink)" as N
participant "Android\nBLE / USB stack" as API
participant "LoRa node\n(Meshtastic / RadioLib fw)" as NODE
participant "peer phone\n+ its own node" as PEER

note over L, NODE
  app<->node framing: 0x46 0x4D magic + u16be(len) + FrameCodec bytes\n
  node<->node air protocol: ENTIRELY the firmware's business (FR-7.2)
  BLE NUS: svc 6e400001-b5a3-f393-e0a9-e50e24dcca9e,
           RX(write w/o response, app->node) 6e400002...,
           TX(notify, node->app) 6e400003...
  USB: usb-serial-for-android, CH340/CP210x/FTDI/CDC-ACM, 115200 8N1
end note

== Link bring-up (BLE variant, T5.1) ==
SM -> L : start(config)
L -> N : connect()
N -> API : BluetoothLeScanner.startScan(filter NUS UUID)
API -> N : onScanResult(node)
N -> API : device.connectGatt -> STATE_CONNECTED
N -> API : gatt.requestMtu(247) -> onMtuChanged
N -> API : gatt.discoverServices() -> onServicesDiscovered
N -> API : setCharacteristicNotification(NUS_TX, true) + write CCCD
N -> L : NodeLinkState.READY
L -> SM : StateChanged(READY)

== Link bring-up (USB variant, T5.1b) ==
L -> N : connect()
N -> API : UsbManager.getDeviceList()\n-> requestPermission(intent) -> openConnection\n-> driver.setBaudRate(115200, 8N1)
N -> L : NodeLinkState.READY
L -> SM : StateChanged(READY)

== Send path ==
SM -> L : send(wireFrame)
L -> L : packet = 0x464D + u16be(len) + wireFrame\nchunks = split(link.mtuPayload)
loop per chunk
  L -> N : write(chunk)
  N -> API : BLE writeCharacteristic(NUS_RX, WO-RESPONSE)\n| USB bulkWrite(endpoint)
  API -> NODE : bytes
end
NODE -> NODE : firmware frames its own LoRa air protocol
NODE -> PEER : LoRa packet over the air (opaque)

== Receive path ==
NODE -> API : LoRa packet received, firmware streams payload
API -> N : RX notify / bulkRead bytes
N -> L : stream chunks up
L -> L : scan for magic, read u16 len,\nreassemble until frame complete
L -> SM : FrameReceived(frame, LORA)

== Watchdog & reconnect (FR-7.4 / FR-7.5) ==
L -> L : if no RX for 30 s or link error ->\nStateChanged(LINK_DOWN),\nTX queue keeps last N=5,\nretry connect with exponential backoff
L -> N : connect() (again)
@enduml
